# 构建上下文白名单: 多阶段构建只需要 manifest + lock + src。
# 星号先排除一切, 再显式放行 —— .git 历史(除了 build.rs 解析
# `git rev-parse HEAD` 需要的 HEAD 指针)、target/、文档、IDE 文件
# 一概进不了 docker daemon。
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!src/**
!build.rs
# Local `make windows` builds rely on build.rs's `git rev-parse HEAD`
# fallback; CI overrides via `--build-arg QUIVER_GIT_SHA=...` and ignores
# this. Only the HEAD pointer matters — full history stays out of the
# context to keep buildx fast.
!.git
!.git/HEAD
